		<title type="html"><![CDATA[PyBullet Support and Feedback • Re: Replicate ai generated animation back in pybullet.]]></title>

					<category term="PyBullet Support and Feedback" scheme="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewforum.php?f=24" label="PyBullet Support and Feedback"/>
		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=44517#p44517"><![CDATA[
To replicate AI-generated animations in PyBullet smoothly, ditch time.sleep() and sync playback to p.stepSimulation() with a fixed timestep like 1/240 Hz,<a href="https://buckshotroulette.com/home" class="postlink"><span style="color:#FFFFFF"><span style="font-size:1%;line-height:116%">Buckshot Roulette</span></span></a> interpolating joint positions between keyframes for fluidity.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=14532">otis</a> — Mon Mar 17, 2025 10:16 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
